    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the Sealed Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
    "",
    "&fUse the ordered sequenced assembly recipe. One loop guarantees one mechanism; the final Deployer holds farmersdelight:iron_knife. Ordinary tools wear; the chapter reward version is unbreakable.",
    "",
