    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fBuild and test the setup described below.",
    "",
    "&fChapter 2 unlocks Nether entry. Capture a Blaze in a burner before heated brass mixing.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fPrepare food, blocks and a return route before collecting a Blaze for your burner."
  ],
  "quest.6BDB4A8936AC6972.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
