    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fHeat copper and zinc in the basin. Press brass sheets and finish electron tubes for the precision sequence.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fSecure Blaze access and heated mixing first. Crushing Wheels now improve the geological processing routes."
