  "quest.1BF8FD74975C2CD0.title": "&f&lWorkshop plan · Inductive Machine&r",
  "quest.1BF8FD74975C2CD0.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fFollow the workshop plan and prepare this tier’s production line.",
    "",
    "&fFollow this chapter’s material and machine path. The previous milestone unlocks this tier. Optional quests introduce supporting systems; milestone rewards grant one unbreakable tool per player.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap with Precision Machines and heated steel before requesting Inductive or Arcane equipment."
  ],
  "quest.1BF8FD74975C2CD0.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "task.CBE8FEA80197597E.title": "Read this workshop plan",
  "quest.70537923DAFF07C8.title": "&f&lBootstrap steel&r",
  "quest.70537923DAFF07C8.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fHeated mixing uses two iron ingots and coal for two steel. Five steel, two osmium and one Precision Machine produce Steel Casing; no FE or boss core is required.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap with Precision Machines and heated steel before requesting Inductive or Arcane equipment."
  ],
  "quest.70537923DAFF07C8.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.C7F128596F0C07EE.title": "&f&lFirst powered processing&r",
  "quest.C7F128596F0C07EE.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fDeploy a Precision Mechanism onto Steel Casing. Add Heat Generator and basic universal cables. Native infusing supplies circuits and alloys.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap with Precision Machines and heated steel before requesting Inductive or Arcane equipment."
  ],
  "quest.C7F128596F0C07EE.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.D3B31F5815AD5CE1.title": "&f&lCharge certus&r",
  "quest.D3B31F5815AD5CE1.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fCraft from Steel Casing, certus and Crafts & Additions Capacitor. Use FE to charge certus; native water conversion produces fluix crystals.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap with Precision Machines and heated steel before requesting Inductive or Arcane equipment."
  ],
  "quest.D3B31F5815AD5CE1.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.FA4B7E64CE1F51F9.title": "&f&lPrint the processors&r",
  "quest.FA4B7E64CE1F51F9.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fSteel Casing + Electric Motor + gold. All four press recipes are available from this chapter; use the normal Inscriber routes.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap with Precision Machines and heated steel before requesting Inductive or Arcane equipment."
  ],
  "quest.FA4B7E64CE1F51F9.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.F95513CFFB01B5ED.title": "&f&lBuild a parallel arcane workshop&r",
  "quest.F95513CFFB01B5ED.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fPrecision Machine bootstraps the apparatus. Bootstrap the Agronomic Sourcelink from wheat, Source Gems, a Source Jar and a Precision Machine. Make Arcane Casing and the sequenced Arcane Mechanism, then deploy the mechanism. Magic supports the factory alongside FE.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap with Precision Machines and heated steel before requesting Inductive or Arcane equipment.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.F95513CFFB01B5ED.quest_subtitle": "&7SIDE PATH",
  "quest.E4C6A33E5D3C2A71.title": "&f&lInductive Mechanism&r",
  "quest.E4C6A33E5D3C2A71.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the Inductive Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
    "",
    "&fUse the ordered sequenced assembly recipe. One loop guarantees one mechanism; the final Deployer holds betterend:iron_hammer. Ordinary tools wear; the chapter reward version is unbreakable.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fStart with Precision Mechanism.",
    "&62. &fDeploy Capacitor.",
    "&63. &fDeploy Fluix Crystal.",
    "&64. &fFinish under a Deployer holding Iron Hammer.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fOne loop guarantees one mechanism. Ordinary finishing tools wear; the chapter reward tool is unbreakable.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fSupply each step separately and keep unfinished mechanisms on their ordered assembly route."
  ],
  "quest.E4C6A33E5D3C2A71.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.0418E87054862F63.title": "&f&lInductive Machine&r",
  "quest.0418E87054862F63.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fDeploy this tier’s mechanism onto its matching casing. Follow the machine’s JEI recipe or the stonecutter output menu for the next equipment choice.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fPut Steel Casing on the belt or depot.",
    "&62. &fDeploy Inductive Mechanism onto it.",
    "&63. &fStonecut the frame into the machine you need.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fEach stonecut output consumes its own frame. Stock several frames for a complete workshop."
  ],
  "quest.0418E87054862F63.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
