  "quest.34ACF5A39BA4283A.title": "&f&lBuild an expedition vessel&r",
  "quest.34ACF5A39BA4283A.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fExpedition Frames unlock actual airship controls. Start with a light hull, balanced propulsion, steering and fuel; Mekanism compatibility adds systems on the moving vessel.",
