    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fBuild reactor, cooling and turbine before adding fuel. Native uranium → yellow cake → uranium oxide → uranium hexafluoride → fissile fuel remains the fuel chain.",
