    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fRoute waste away from normal gas storage. Use native barrels and solar neutron activation; never vent waste. Route polonium/plutonium with their native restrictions.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBuild cooling and waste handling before fuel production. The first containment equipment needs no radioactive input."
  ],
