  "quest.62515C77E5CF82DA.title": "&f&lNucleosynthesize a Stargaze&r",
  "quest.62515C77E5CF82DA.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fOne AE2 Singularity + 10 antimatter units → one Stargaze Singularity in the Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer. Deploy a retained Void Core onto it, then use the Void-attuned Singularity with polonium for the next mechanism.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment."
  ],
  "quest.62515C77E5CF82DA.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.440135A1AF97963D.title": "&f&lSingularity Mechanism&r",
  "quest.440135A1AF97963D.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the Singularity Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
    "",
    "&fUse the ordered sequenced assembly recipe. One loop guarantees one mechanism; the final Deployer holds ars_nouveau:enchanters_sword. Ordinary tools wear; the chapter reward version is unbreakable.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fStart with Containment Mechanism.",
    "&62. &fDeploy Pellet Polonium.",
    "&63. &fDeploy Void-attuned Singularity.",
    "&64. &fFinish under a Deployer holding Enchanters Sword.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fOne loop guarantees one mechanism. Ordinary finishing tools wear; the chapter reward tool is unbreakable.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fSupply each step separately and keep unfinished mechanisms on their ordered assembly route."
  ],
  "quest.440135A1AF97963D.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.C3CF0249BE5B955C.title": "&f&lSingularity Frame&r",
  "quest.C3CF0249BE5B955C.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fDeploy this tier’s mechanism onto its matching casing. Follow the machine’s JEI recipe or the stonecutter output menu for the next equipment choice.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fPut Fluix Block on the belt or depot.",
    "&62. &fDeploy Singularity Mechanism onto it.",
    "&63. &fStonecut the frame into the machine you need.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fEach stonecut output consumes its own frame. Stock several frames for a complete workshop."
  ],
  "quest.C3CF0249BE5B955C.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.4071EFEAA0B4826C.title": "&f&lPower quantum production&r",
  "quest.4071EFEAA0B4826C.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fFusion requires native deuterium/tritium and ignition. SPS and quantum networks consume real energy; size the power line for sustained production.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment."
  ],
  "quest.4071EFEAA0B4826C.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.441218FF23DE39C8.title": "&f&lLink distant factories&r",
  "quest.441218FF23DE39C8.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&f64k storage and quantum bridges support distant production while preserving AE2’s native channels and link rules.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment."
  ],
  "quest.441218FF23DE39C8.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.1EAF5BC1918535CA.title": "&f&lDefeat Ender Guardian&r",
  "quest.1EAF5BC1918535CA.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fA player kill awards the reusable core. Keep it for imprinting; repeated kills add parallel production capacity.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment."
  ],
  "quest.1EAF5BC1918535CA.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.4AFA996B86872BD4.title": "&f&lKeep the Void Core&r",
  "quest.4AFA996B86872BD4.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fBoss cores are permanent catalysts. Retained deployment recipes leave the core in the Deployer.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fDo not route boss catalysts into void upgrades, disposal or general ingredient consumption.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.4AFA996B86872BD4.quest_subtitle": "&7SIDE PATH",
  "quest.212C96D0B82DD548.title": "&f&lRun the workshop continuously&r",
  "quest.212C96D0B82DD548.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fBuild and test the setup described below.",
    "",
    "&fDemonstrate a complete material → mechanism → casing/frame → machine line. Set filters, buffers and output handling; confirm it runs without manual ingredient insertion.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fStock the raw-material buffers.",
    "&62. &fRun material → mechanism → casing/frame → machine.",
    "&63. &fTest repeated batches and output collection without hand-feeding.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project."
  ],
  "quest.212C96D0B82DD548.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "task.45DE8012948850B8.title": "Confirm the working setup",
  "quest.DD2408B49260ECA5.title": "&6&l◆ COMPLETE CHAPTER 9&r",
  "quest.DD2408B49260ECA5.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete this chapter and claim your permanent workshop tool.",
    "",
    "&fClaim your unbreakable workshop tool. Completing this chapter unlocks the next tier for the team, including offline players when they next join.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fClaim your own reward manually. The tool is awarded once per player, even on a shared team."
  ],
  "quest.DD2408B49260ECA5.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "task.5B98B301611C26AA.title": "Confirm the working setup",
  "quest.7F334B7B47C8B52F.title": "&f&lBoss encounters&r",
  "quest.7F334B7B47C8B52F.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fBuild and test the setup described below.",
    "",
    "&fCataclysm, Bosses’ Rise and Mowzie’s Mobs remain combat destinations. Only the explicitly listed core-bearing bosses are mandatory milestones.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBootstrap SPS and nucleosynthesis with Containment Frames before planning Singularity equipment.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.7F334B7B47C8B52F.quest_subtitle": "&7SIDE PATH",
  "task.2B681F9B3EED2473.title": "Confirm the working setup",
  "chapter.C3C4EE5EFEBE5FFC.title": "&b10 ◆ &f&lSovereign · A Renewable Kingdom&r",
  "chapter.C3C4EE5EFEBE5FFC.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Sovereign Core and connected production"
  ],
  "quest.048DD0D80436286A.title": "&f&lWorkshop plan · Sovereign Core&r",
  "quest.048DD0D80436286A.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fFollow the workshop plan and prepare this tier’s production line.",
    "",
    "&fFollow this chapter’s material and machine path. The previous milestone unlocks this tier. Optional quests introduce supporting systems; milestone rewards grant one unbreakable tool per player.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep all five core catalysts and test the complete input chain before scaling Sovereign production."
  ],
  "quest.048DD0D80436286A.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "task.75FBB6993724F9CC.title": "Read this workshop plan",
  "quest.11202848E5630522.title": "&f&lImprint the Sovereign Keystone&r",
  "quest.11202848E5630522.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fDeploy Verdant Sigil, Storm Core, Ember Core, Void Core and Dragon Core onto a Sovereign Core in one sequence. Every core is retained; finish using the ordinary Enchanter’s Sword.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep all five core catalysts and test the complete input chain before scaling Sovereign production."
  ],
  "quest.11202848E5630522.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.A2F7B45A45898E5F.title": "&f&lSovereign Mechanism&r",
  "quest.A2F7B45A45898E5F.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the Sovereign Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
    "",
    "&fUse the ordered sequenced assembly recipe. One loop guarantees one mechanism; the final Deployer holds betterend:diamond_hammer. Ordinary tools wear; the chapter reward version is unbreakable.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fStart with Singularity Mechanism.",
    "&62. &fDeploy Pellet Antimatter.",
    "&63. &fDeploy Dragon Breath.",
    "&64. &fFinish under a Deployer holding Diamond Hammer.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fOne loop guarantees one mechanism. Ordinary finishing tools wear; the chapter reward tool is unbreakable.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fSupply each step separately and keep unfinished mechanisms on their ordered assembly route."
  ],
  "quest.A2F7B45A45898E5F.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.94FE0E1F50545C0B.title": "&f&lSovereign Core&r",
  "quest.94FE0E1F50545C0B.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fDeploy this tier’s mechanism onto its matching casing. Follow the machine’s JEI recipe or the stonecutter output menu for the next equipment choice.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fPut Sps Casing on the belt or depot.",
    "&62. &fDeploy Sovereign Mechanism onto it.",
    "&63. &fStonecut the frame into the machine you need.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fEach stonecut output consumes its own frame. Stock several frames for a complete workshop."
  ],
  "quest.94FE0E1F50545C0B.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.DF8CD8E80FF1BEBC.title": "&f&lEquip the industrial kingdom&r",
  "quest.DF8CD8E80FF1BEBC.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fSovereign Cores build the advanced equipment layer. Modules, energy and native upgrade components are still required.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep all five core catalysts and test the complete input chain before scaling Sovereign production."
  ],
  "quest.DF8CD8E80FF1BEBC.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.7EB5D20B6EA27606.title": "&f&lFinish the large ME network&r",
  "quest.7EB5D20B6EA27606.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fUse native preserving upgrades to reach 256k. Storage capacity supports production; creative cells and infinity upgrades remain unavailable.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep all five core catalysts and test the complete input chain before scaling Sovereign production."
  ],
  "quest.7EB5D20B6EA27606.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "quest.9D5F5CBAB5E5175A.title": "&f&lRun the workshop continuously&r",
  "quest.9D5F5CBAB5E5175A.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fBuild and test the setup described below.",
    "",
    "&fDemonstrate a complete material → mechanism → casing/frame → machine line. Set filters, buffers and output handling; confirm it runs without manual ingredient insertion.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fStock the raw-material buffers.",
    "&62. &fRun material → mechanism → casing/frame → machine.",
    "&63. &fTest repeated batches and output collection without hand-feeding.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep all five core catalysts and test the complete input chain before scaling Sovereign production.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project."
  ],
  "quest.9D5F5CBAB5E5175A.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "task.5E0FA82F8E86203A.title": "Confirm the working setup",
  "quest.502988B461C73519.title": "&6&l◆ COMPLETE CHAPTER 10&r",
  "quest.502988B461C73519.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete this chapter and claim your permanent workshop tool.",
    "",
    "&fClaim the unbreakable Sovereign workshop tool. All ten workshop tiers are complete; continue settlement projects, exploration and renewable production.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fClaim your own reward manually. The tool is awarded once per player, even on a shared team."
  ],
  "quest.502988B461C73519.quest_subtitle": "&7CAMPAIGN",
  "task.4649906D1BD8CE34.title": "Confirm the working setup",
  "quest.72B5209695E2DD48.title": "&f&lUseful settlement details&r",
  "quest.72B5209695E2DD48.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
    "",
    "&fSupplementaries and Amendments supply practical building and interaction tools. Waystones support travel alongside airships and quantum links.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep all five core catalysts and test the complete input chain before scaling Sovereign production.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.72B5209695E2DD48.quest_subtitle": "&7SIDE PATH",
  "chapter.5F960AF93FE7220C.title": "&d◆ &f&lWelcome to Towns & Kingdoms&r",
  "chapter.5F960AF93FE7220C.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Start here · quest types, controls and your first workshop"
  ],
  "quest.75358291ED74276A.title": "&f&lYour kingdom starts here&r",
  "quest.75358291ED74276A.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fFind your main progression route and the supporting guides.",
    "",
    "&fEngineering, magic, exploration and settlement building share one adventure. Chapters I–X are the production spine. The other categories are guides and optional projects you can revisit at any time.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fRead this welcome page.",
    "&62. &fFind the six category headings in the chapter sidebar.",
    "&63. &fOpen Chapter I and locate its workshop plan.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fOpen Mechanical Quests when you want the next machine; open Character Paths when choosing your build.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.75358291ED74276A.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.72EAF2BF73D452EA.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.249C1CC92546E539.title": "&f&lReading the quest board&r",
  "quest.249C1CC92546E539.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fRound item nodes detect an item in your inventory. Guide checkmarks mean you have read the explanation; activity checkmarks mean you have completed the described setup. Large gold milestones unlock the next workshop tier.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fReading guides is safe for the whole team. You can compare all classes without selecting them.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fA checkmark does not automatically test a farm, choose a class or award skill points.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.249C1CC92546E539.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.33A394DC59000798.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.7C1873AD990A9E2E.title": "&f&lClaim your workshop rewards&r",
  "quest.7C1873AD990A9E2E.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fItem goals do not consume your materials. Each chapter milestone awards its named unbreakable finishing tool once per player. Rewards use manual claiming, so revisit completed milestones and collect your own tool.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fOpen a completed milestone.",
    "&62. &fClick its reward to claim it.",
    "&63. &fStore your workshop tools separately from adventuring gear.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fPut the reward tool into the finishing Deployer; stock replaceable tools while you are still building the chapter.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.7C1873AD990A9E2E.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.247323417B206992.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.1E81CE264FFD66B0.title": "&f&lTeams and personal choices&r",
  "quest.1E81CE264FFD66B0.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fThe campaign uses FTB team quest progress. Workshop stages synchronize with completed milestones when a teammate next logs in. Your skilltree class, subclass and profession investments remain personal.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fAgree on who handles crops, processing and exploration, then share the finished supplies.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fA teammate completing a class guide does not choose that class for you.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.1E81CE264FFD66B0.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.601B128FBD469AA6.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.0DDD493E88BF81ED.title": "&f&lSet up your controls&r",
  "quest.0DDD493E88BF81ED.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fSeveral mods add controls for quests, the map, parkour, combat and the skilltree. Open Minecraft Controls and search each mod name. Resolve conflicting keybinds before testing combat or a new movement ability.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCheck FTB Quests and map controls.",
    "&62. &fCheck Epic Fight, ParCool and spell controls.",
    "&63. &fCheck the skilltree shortcut.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fSearch Passive Skill Tree for the class tree. The supplied tree notes O as its intended shortcut, but your actual keybind may differ.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.0DDD493E88BF81ED.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.70A7441671529B1D.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.5040D9B1F28AC74F.title": "&f&lRead the actual recipe&r",
  "quest.5040D9B1F28AC74F.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fUse JEI to look up an item’s recipe and uses, then check every process tab. This pack changes important machine and mechanism recipes. Item names alone do not tell you which frame or processing method is required.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fLook up Algal Blend.",
    "&62. &fCompare its manual and mixing routes.",
    "&63. &fLook up the uses of a Kinetic Machine.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fJEI bookmarks make a useful shopping list. Keep the casing, mechanism and finishing tool together in your plan.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.5040D9B1F28AC74F.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.3AF5A55863CA195C.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.41296AB2FFE6CF47.title": "&f&lLearn a machine with Ponder&r",
  "quest.41296AB2FFE6CF47.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fSupported Create items have in-game Ponder scenes for placement, rotation and interactions. Follow the tooltip’s Ponder shortcut. Use JEI for the pack’s exact ingredients and the recipe workshop on the official wiki for assembly order.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fInspect a Deployer tooltip.",
    "&62. &fOpen its available Ponder scene.",
    "&63. &fCompare the machine explanation with its T&K3 recipe.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fPonder explains the machine; the T&K3 recipe entry tells you what this pack requires.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.41296AB2FFE6CF47.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.5CF3CC2B8C7210DA.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.41875AF043D7B2EA.title": "&f&lRead the block in front of you&r",
  "quest.41875AF043D7B2EA.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fJade supplies block and entity information when available. Tooltips, machine screens and recipe viewers together help identify a stalled process: wrong ingredient, missing power, wrong side or an unavailable tier.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fCheck the destination inventory first when a belt stops moving.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.41875AF043D7B2EA.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.15D194747FF1073A.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.333C4033DAE40302.title": "&f&lMark home and protect it&r",
  "quest.333C4033DAE40302.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fUse the selected map and FTB Chunks tools to mark home, claim your workshop and review team permissions. Claims, loading limits and server permissions depend on the instance settings.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCreate a home waypoint.",
    "&62. &fReview your team’s claim permissions.",
    "&63. &fKeep a clear route to the workshop.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fName waypoints for farms, portals and unfinished projects, not just your main house.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.333C4033DAE40302.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.1511C274AE3A94AF.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.03D6646CA4207630.title": "&f&lKnow the workshop gates&r",
  "quest.03D6646CA4207630.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fAndesite starts the factory; Copper adds fields and fluids; Brass opens the Nether. Chapter IV adds AE2 and Mekanism. Chapter V opens End progression. Chemistry, expeditions, containment, quantum industry and the Sovereign project follow.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fA side guide may show a future project. Its TIER label and dependency indicate when you can complete it.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.03D6646CA4207630.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.550CC25C1DBFB242.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.5319A38A948520A6.title": "&f&lA board full of useful symbols&r",
  "quest.5319A38A948520A6.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fThe supplied quest and information artwork is used as navigation art throughout this book. Books introduce guides, maps mark expeditions, job icons mark professions and large milestone nodes mark chapter completion.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fQuest/info icons are reading aids. They are not ingredients or items you must craft for progression.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.5319A38A948520A6.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.09185BE6332D29E6.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "chapter.15A76C7204A7F51C.title": "&d◆ &f&lThe First Few Days&r",
  "chapter.15A76C7204A7F51C.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Shelter, supplies and a workshop that can grow"
  ],
  "quest.35A555D8D89382FA.title": "&f&lChoose a place to begin&r",
  "quest.35A555D8D89382FA.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fLook for access to water, space for crops and a level workshop footprint. Leave room for belts, tanks, a stone generator and later machine rooms rather than fitting every process into your bedroom.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fSet up shelter and a bed.",
    "&62. &fMark a workshop area.",
    "&63. &fReserve a separate storage corner.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fA workshop next to the farm shortens the first wheat and kelp supply routes.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.35A555D8D89382FA.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.3B2F9793A79BFBEF.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.0C0C20356D043CF8.title": "&f&lKeep your expedition fed&r",
  "quest.0C0C20356D043CF8.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fBuild a steady food supply before traveling far. Farmer’s Delight and the selected cooking mods offer useful meal choices. Check a meal’s tooltip and available ingredients before planning mass production.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fCarry one reliable food stack and reserve special meals for longer trips.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.0C0C20356D043CF8.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.36015FABFDDF142B.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.528AC548C569B457.title": "&f&lThe first industrial crops&r",
  "quest.528AC548C569B457.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fWheat and kelp serve both food and machine progression. Clay feeds Algal Blend, and limestone processing can supply bone meal. Keep seeds and replanting stock out of the factory’s consumption buffer.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fPlant wheat.",
    "&62. &fStart a kelp patch in water.",
    "&63. &fReserve a chest for crops and seeds.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fA small reliable farm is more useful than a large farm with nowhere for its harvest to go.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.528AC548C569B457.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.17966F370FE0BEBF.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.43935EB38B16F0E6.title": "&f&lHandcraft the starting frame&r",
  "quest.43935EB38B16F0E6.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fChapter I deliberately starts before automated mechanisms. Seven Andesite Alloy, a wooden slab and Andesite Casing craft the first Kinetic Machine. Use the manual route to obtain the machines that will automate the mechanisms.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fMake Algal Blend and Andesite Alloy.",
    "&62. &fCraft the manual Kinetic Machine.",
    "&63. &fStonecut the required starter equipment.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBudget several starting frames: each stonecut machine choice consumes its own frame.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.43935EB38B16F0E6.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.2DD1B5656754615D.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.481FEC28EE03D3D2.title": "&f&lGive every process an output&r",
  "quest.481FEC28EE03D3D2.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fA chest, hopper or an appropriate collection upgrade turns a working machine into a useful supply line. Decide where items arrive and what should happen when that inventory fills.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fHopper Upgrades transfer to adjacent inventories. Pickup Upgrades collect dropped items; these are different jobs.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.481FEC28EE03D3D2.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.028A1A86A86C9ABF.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.4A6AF6464F3A9F3C.title": "&f&lA working first workshop&r",
  "quest.4A6AF6464F3A9F3C.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fFinish a compact area with water power, a press, a mixer and deployers. Leave paths to access filters and replace tools. Continue Chapter I for the exact progression goals.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fLabel the ingredient buffers so you can return after an expedition and understand your own factory.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.4A6AF6464F3A9F3C.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.6B725F33B8DF249A.title": "Complete this activity",
  "chapter.5909027F9B892503.title": "&d◆ &f&lThe Town Project Board&r",
  "chapter.5909027F9B892503.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Optional community builds · use the board as your settlement checklist"
  ],
  "quest.1438C9A211981242.title": "&f&lPick a shared project&r",
  "quest.1438C9A211981242.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fThis board is a collection of voluntary settlement goals. Choose projects that suit your team and current tier. The checkmarks record your work; the campaign milestones remain in Mechanical Quests.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fWrite the project owner and required supplies on signs at the construction site.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.1438C9A211981242.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.4FA5503783592AD8.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.0CA9A1A234F4E043.title": "&f&lThe town storehouse&r",
  "quest.0CA9A1A234F4E043.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fBuild a central room with named storage, an incoming materials area and a tools shelf. Keep personal equipment apart from community ingredients.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fReserve separate shelves for unfinished mechanisms and reusable boss cores.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.0CA9A1A234F4E043.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.086B377ACD762D84.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.526C465358930220.title": "&f&lThe public kitchen&r",
  "quest.526C465358930220.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fConnect a crop store to a kitchen, prepare a repeatable meal and create an accessible food reserve for builders and adventurers.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep seeds, animal feed and the next recipe batch in separate buffers.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.526C465358930220.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.4FEF5094437A8C75.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.51102544A98CD812.title": "&f&lThe workshop road&r",
  "quest.51102544A98CD812.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fConnect the workshop, homes and farms with a lit road. Leave clearance for carts, contraptions and future transport stations.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fBuild the path before placing machines across the route.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.51102544A98CD812.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.63160501AD7C914E.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.3C81767A4499AD8E.title": "&f&lThe guild library&r",
  "quest.3C81767A4499AD8E.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fCreate a place for mod guides, enchanting supplies and the team’s build notes. Give magic experiments their own work surface.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fPut a sign beside each area listing its main ingredients and purpose.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.3C81767A4499AD8E.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.6E2EFFA6C69D97D0.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.1139DA158CD685AE.title": "&f&lThe training yard&r",
  "quest.1139DA158CD685AE.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fPrepare a safe practice area away from villagers and factory equipment. Test weapon moves, spells and mobility before a difficult expedition.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fUse the selected Dummy mod for controlled equipment comparisons when its target is available.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.1139DA158CD685AE.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.7F654DBE03590453.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.7E4312F28D41AA58.title": "&f&lThe expedition locker&r",
  "quest.7E4312F28D41AA58.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fPrepare shared supplies for a trip: food, spare tools, blocks, a return plan and free loot space. Add a board for destinations and discovered structures.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep a recovery kit at home instead of carrying every useful item into the same fight.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.7E4312F28D41AA58.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.084E8302A7DDFB6E.title": "Complete this activity",
  "quest.41180601E897DDA7.title": "&f&lThe kingdom museum&r",
  "quest.41180601E897DDA7.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fComplete the project described below.",
    "",
    "&fDisplay important discoveries, decorative blocks and notes about boss victories. Keep working progression catalysts in secure storage rather than using them as disposable decorations.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fMake a labelled display copy where possible and retain the production original.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.41180601E897DDA7.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.21BDE8762A3D7EEC.title": "Complete this activity",
  "chapter.25A542BBDC70174D.title": "&d◆ &f&lThe Class Atlas&r",
  "chapter.25A542BBDC70174D.chapter_subtitle": [
    "6 classes · 18 subclasses · personal choices in the skilltree"
  ],
  "quest.0077581EFFB1C852.title": "&f&lChoose how you like to play&r",
  "quest.0077581EFFB1C852.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fWarrior, Ranger, Rogue, Mage, Cleric and Occultist offer different combat foundations. Read all six class pages, then make your actual choice in the personal skilltree.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fYou can complete every reading guide here. The questbook does not lock your class choice.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fThese quests grant no class, attribute modifier, skill point or reset item.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.0077581EFFB1C852.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.16CA42C3F2912D71.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.445FFC76F180A6BE.title": "&f&lOne class, one subclass&r",
  "quest.445FFC76F180A6BE.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fThe supplied tree restricts you to one class root and one subclass root. Each class has three subclass options with positive bonuses and meaningful tradeoffs. Compare those tradeoffs before investing.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fChoose the playstyle you enjoy during ordinary fights, not only a boss damage screenshot.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.445FFC76F180A6BE.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.2BF78D95C0E91CC3.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.2464CB320F85B809.title": "&f&lBuild the class foundation&r",
  "quest.2464CB320F85B809.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fEach class has five mandatory inner branches with four nodes each: twenty foundation nodes. Follow the displayed prerequisite route through class mastery and the specialization gate to reach a subclass.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fThe twenty foundation nodes are not the entire cost of reaching a subclass; approach, root and gate nodes also matter.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.2464CB320F85B809.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.3D017E02DDAE9B30.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.66EF24AD8E2E7120.title": "&f&lEvery node is a decision&r",
  "quest.66EF24AD8E2E7120.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fEvery native node in the supplied tree costs one point. Point availability follows the installed Passive Skill Tree settings. A quest guide does not generate extra points or create a separate profession leveling system.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fRead the next node’s prerequisite and tradeoff before buying it.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fA recommended point budget in development notes is not a promise that your instance grants those points.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.66EF24AD8E2E7120.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.2BEA6809C5065295.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.07FBD158781540A6.title": "&f&lThree paths inside a subclass&r",
  "quest.07FBD158781540A6.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fEach subclass has three independent fourteen-node paths. Follow each branch’s own learned-skill requirements. The optional synergy nodes are side destinations; they do not skip another path’s requirements.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fFocus on a useful path first. The all-path apex rewards completing the foundation of all three paths.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.07FBD158781540A6.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.4539A745E5BFC7E8.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.0C425E948B9EEDF1.title": "&f&lRead your apex carefully&r",
  "quest.0C425E948B9EEDF1.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fThe tree permits one subclass keystone. Advanced class branches and profession investments compete for the same points, so decide whether you want a broad character or deeper specialization.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fSketch a point plan with your desired subclass path and professions before spending the last available points.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.0C425E948B9EEDF1.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.1D3C02C882FD9426.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.49475F9ED0BF7F85.title": "&f&lProfessions alongside combat&r",
  "quest.49475F9ED0BF7F85.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fSeven profession islands support Mining, Logging, Hunting, Exploration, Fishing, Farming and Crafting. The supplied tree permits up to three profession masteries and up to three focus nodes within each profession.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fA class does not force a profession. A Mage can farm and a Warrior can craft.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.49475F9ED0BF7F85.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.094347CEACE90B3C.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.022E0143EE58CD1A.title": "&f&lMatch equipment to your tree&r",
  "quest.022E0143EE58CD1A.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fA tree bonus only helps when its conditions and relevant attribute apply. Compare weapon type, school, casting cost, armor and movement rather than choosing equipment solely for its rarity.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fUse the item tooltip and the actual skill node as the final description of their effects.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.022E0143EE58CD1A.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.42E03E6F40A1AEC6.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "chapter.788044373071E04C.title": "&c◆ &f&lPath of the Warrior&r",
  "chapter.788044373071E04C.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Class foundation · compare all three specializations"
  ],
  "quest.139B63A97ABA0168.title": "&f&lWarrior at a glance&r",
  "quest.139B63A97ABA0168.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fDecide whether this combat foundation suits you.",
    "",
    "&fMelee pressure, health and a durable frontline. Read the three specializations below, then make your personal investment in the skilltree.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fReading this page does not select the class. Compare the root’s bonuses and penalties on the actual skill node.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.139B63A97ABA0168.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.7B25EC296E2C26F4.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.6D2F55F7B7F49C2B.title": "&f&lBuild your foundation&r",
  "quest.6D2F55F7B7F49C2B.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fYour five inner branches are Weapon Training, Battle Rhythm, Endurance, Iron Guard and Pressure. Each branch contains four mandatory foundation nodes. Complete their requirements, class mastery and the specialization gate before entering a subclass.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fTwenty inner foundation nodes are only part of the route; account for entry, root, mastery and gate nodes too.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.6D2F55F7B7F49C2B.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.08DAD22A1EB5C446.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.025F56A4101E661C.title": "&f&lBerserker&r",
  "quest.025F56A4101E661C.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand the Berserker playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
    "",
    "&fHigher attack damage and stronger critical damage; lower maximum health and reduced healing received. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
    "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Fury · Brutality · Blood Price.",
    "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fKeep a reliable food and recovery supply. Trading defense for damage makes retreat timing more important.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.025F56A4101E661C.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.35EB416DAD62CE9A.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.3D2CBF0CD9798FE9.title": "&f&lBerserker · three paths&r",
  "quest.3D2CBF0CD9798FE9.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fThe Berserker constellation contains three independent fourteen-node paths: Fury · Brutality · Blood Price. Optional synergy notables support combinations; the all-path apex checks all three branches.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fFinish each branch through its own prerequisites; a synergy node is not a shortcut to a different apex.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
