    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand the Weapon Master playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
    "",
    "&fMore attack damage and attack speed; lower armor at the subclass root. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
    "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Technique · Tempo · Precision.",
    "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fCompare a weapon’s speed and moves as well as its listed damage before settling on a favorite.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
