  "quest.7958E9F37D53BEAC.title": "&f&lRanger at a glance&r",
  "quest.7958E9F37D53BEAC.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fDecide whether this combat foundation suits you.",
    "",
    "&fProjectile damage, movement and a mobile field-combat foundation. Read the three specializations below, then make your personal investment in the skilltree.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fReading this page does not select the class. Compare the root’s bonuses and penalties on the actual skill node.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.7958E9F37D53BEAC.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.306993DCF3558D99.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.3DE6EF0509D06C8B.title": "&f&lBuild your foundation&r",
  "quest.3DE6EF0509D06C8B.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fYour five inner branches are Archery, Quick Draw, Trailcraft, Steady Aim and Fieldcraft. Each branch contains four mandatory foundation nodes. Complete their requirements, class mastery and the specialization gate before entering a subclass.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fTwenty inner foundation nodes are only part of the route; account for entry, root, mastery and gate nodes too.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.3DE6EF0509D06C8B.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.2E2D7E7F751997B2.title": "Read and understand this guide",
  "quest.39EDF94BD7A32934.title": "&f&lMarksman&r",
  "quest.39EDF94BD7A32934.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand the Marksman playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
    "",
    "&fMore projectile damage and faster bow drawing; lower movement speed. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
    "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Long Shot · Quick Draw · Deadeye.",
    "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fChoose firing positions with a clear retreat path instead of relying on speed to escape.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
