    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand the Elementalist playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
    "",
    "&fSupports Fire, Ice and Lightning schools, with cooldown support where the attribute is available. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
    "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Fire Mastery · Ice Mastery · Lightning Mastery.",
    "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fCompare the school on each spell; school bonuses do not automatically affect every addon spell.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
