    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand the Battlemage playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
    "",
    "&fMore melee damage and spell power; reduced mana regeneration and cooldown-reduction value. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
    "",
    "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
    "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
    "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Spellsteel · Battle Casting · Arcane Guard.",
    "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fThe reduced cooldown-reduction value is a tradeoff. Plan longer gaps between casts, with a useful weapon in between.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
