  "quest.2345ABC9043CD3EE.title": "&f&lBuild your foundation&r",
  "quest.2345ABC9043CD3EE.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fYour five inner branches are Faith, Prayer, Grace, Sacred Guard and Wisdom. Each branch contains four mandatory foundation nodes. Complete their requirements, class mastery and the specialization gate before entering a subclass.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fTwenty inner foundation nodes are only part of the route; account for entry, root, mastery and gate nodes too.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
