    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fThe activity check records your practice. It does not require you to spend points or commit to this class.",
    "",
    "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.639049047227E96C.quest_subtitle": "&7ACTIVITY",
  "task.276378EE64EBB500.title": "Complete this activity",
  "chapter.3F65F3CEC3E922EA.title": "&d◆ &f&lProfessions & Everyday Work&r",
  "chapter.3F65F3CEC3E922EA.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Seven profession islands · activities that support your kingdom"
  ],
  "quest.259781C02408F89F.title": "&f&lChoose useful everyday strengths&r",
  "quest.259781C02408F89F.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fMining, Logging, Hunting, Exploration, Fishing, Farming and Crafting are skilltree investments alongside your combat build. You may take up to three profession masteries and up to three of the six focus nodes in each profession.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fYou can still do every activity without specializing in its profession.",
    "",
    "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
    "&fThese activities do not implement a separate profession XP counter or award automatic skill points.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
  "quest.259781C02408F89F.quest_subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE",
  "task.276AAE8BA3FBAA90.title": "Read and understand this guide",
