  "quest.43B7C98685A78B21.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fExcavation and mining speed, ore-loot duplication chance and interaction reach. Inspect the three branches and six focus options in your personal tree before committing points.",
    "",
    "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
    "&fCheck a loot-duplication node’s ore conditions. It is a chance, not a guaranteed double output.",
    "",
    "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
    "",
    "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
  ],
