  "quest.51E7F92BBED743D6.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fFishing-loot duplication chance, luck and fishing-rod durability. Inspect the three branches and six focus options in your personal tree before committing points.",
