  "quest.69D0AC2B863C04A7.title": "&f&lFarming · profession&r",
  "quest.69D0AC2B863C04A7.quest_desc": [
    "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
    "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
    "",
    "&fInteraction reach, health support for farm work and hoe-conditioned breaking speed. Inspect the three branches and six focus options in your personal tree before committing points.",
